(3) On and after the effective date of this amendment, "occupational license" means all of the following:

(a) An occupational license as that term is defined in section 4798.01 of the Revised Code;

(b) A certification as that term is defined in section 4798.01 of the Revised Code;

(c) A business license that requires the applicant to satisfy a personal qualification.
